    pmh: "Type 2 Diabetes (20 years), Hypertension (20 years), CKD Stage 3b (eGFR 38), Ischaemic Heart Disease (post-MI 5 years ago, on dual antiplatelet), Heart Failure with reduced EF (EF 40%), Atrial Fibrillation (CHA2DS2VASc 7), Osteoarthritis (knees, hips), Benign Prostatic Hyperplasia, Depression (mild), Insomnia. Also has Obesity.",
